ESC is neutral. Apply calibration forces along the rig's measurement axis.
Remove the applied force, then type tare and wait for completion.
Apply a known force; type point <newtons> to record it, e.g. point 9.80665
Repeat for several loads, then type fit. Each point averages 40 fresh readings.
Commands: tare | point <N> | fit | show | exit. Calibration is RAM-only.

